---
---

<section class="section-wrapper" id="human-escalation">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal-fade-up">
      <div class="eyebrow-container">
        <div class="eyebrow-line"></div>
        <p class="eyebrow-text">WARM ESCALATION PROTOCOL</p>
        <div class="eyebrow-line"></div>
      </div>
      <h2>AI when it can. Humans when they should.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        Shris AI automatically transfers complex conversations to human specialists with complete contextual briefings and zero customer friction.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Showcase Grid -->
    <div class="escalation-grid card-light reveal-fade-up">
      <div class="handoff-steps-row">
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="handoff-box">
          <div class="hb-head">
            <span class="hb-num">01</span>
            <span class="badge badge-indigo">Monitoring</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="hb-title">Sentiment & Confidence Tracking</h3>
          <p class="hb-desc">
            The neural engine continuously evaluates objection severity and caller requests for human specialists.
          </p>
          <div class="hb-code">
            <code>if (confidence &lt; 0.85 || request === "HUMAN")</code>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hb-sep">➔</div>

        <!-- Step 2 (Dark Card) -->
        <div class="handoff-box card-dark">
          <div class="hb-head">
            <span class="hb-num" style="color: #A5BBFC;">02</span>
            <span class="badge badge-emerald">Screen-Pop</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="hb-title" style="color: #FFFFFF;">Real-Time Context Packaging</h3>
          <p class="hb-desc" style="color: #94A3B8;">
            Within 200ms, Shris AI synthesizes the call into a 3-bullet briefing with verified intent and customer parameters.
          </p>
          <div class="hb-briefing">
            <span>• Lead: Marcus (Budget: ₹1.5Cr)</span>
            <span>• Need: 3 BHK Falcon City Luxury</span>
            <span>• Reason: Requesting custom payment plan</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hb-sep">➔</div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="handoff-box">
          <div class="hb-head">
            <span class="hb-num">03</span>
            <span class="badge badge-emerald">Warm Handoff</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="hb-title">Seamless Human Pickup</h3>
          <p class="hb-desc">
            The Account Executive answers already knowing the customer’s exact requirements without asking them to repeat themselves.
          </p>
          <div class="hb-quote">
            <em>"Hi Marcus! I see you are looking at the 3 BHK corner unit. Let's look at the custom schedule together."</em>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .escalation-grid {
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
  }

  .handoff-steps-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .handoff-box {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: #F8F9FC;
    border: 1px solid rgba(30, 32, 51, 0.08);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    height: 100%;
  }

  .handoff-box.card-dark {
    background: #1E2033;
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  }

  .hb-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .hb-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--sf-indigo-500);
  }

  .hb-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: #1E2033;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .hb-desc {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--sf-tx-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .hb-code {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid rgba(30, 32, 51, 0.1);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--sf-slate-900);
  }

  .hb-briefing {
    background: #141624;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    color: #E2E8F0;
  }

  .hb-quote {
    background: #ECFDF5;
    border: 1px solid #A7F3D0;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #065F46;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .hb-sep {
    color: #94A3B8;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .handoff-steps-row {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .hb-sep {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      margin: 0.5rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
